MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Logo: LinkY black + 101 yellow everywhere (no red)
- Nav: each tab gets its own coloured underline (yellow/green/pink/sky/purple)
- Learn: vibrant 2-col category grid, in-place lesson lists, Up Next card
- Podcasts + Quizzes tabs fully styled with clean vibrant cards
- Community renamed Feed with 5 realistic starter posts + welcome card
- Discover filled: opportunities spotlight, topic grid, ambassadors, podcast teaser
- Opportunities: real UK programmes (Tycoon, TeenTech, YE, SfS, Springpod, King's Trust)
- Ambassadors page matching original site (Nick Newman, Jason Stockwood, etc)
- Premium: value-led Pro page, £4.99/mo / £29.99/yr with save badge, Pro chips
- Home: real stats, auto-tracked Today's Goals, opportunity of the week
- Onboarding, verify, settings, notifications, quiz play, chat all restyled
- All XP/level leftovers removed from user-facing pages

